1. DEFINITIONS
"FormaDS" or "SDK" means the original software components, source code,
binary distributions, documentation, design tokens, themes and related original
materials distributed by the Licensor, excluding Third-Party Materials.
"Licensor" means Nuno Domingues, reachable for licensing matters at
formadesignsystem@gmail.com.
"Licensee" means the person or legal entity accepting these terms.
"Application" means software developed by Licensee that incorporates the SDK
as a dependency and exposes functionality beyond the SDK itself.
"Third-Party Materials" means fonts, icons, libraries, assets and other
materials licensed by third parties under separate terms.
"Personal Use" means development and distribution by a natural person acting
independently, solely for noncommercial purposes, without revenue, advertising,
sponsorship, subscriptions, paid features, client work, paid employment-related
use or other direct or indirect business benefit.
"Commercial Use" means any use outside the Personal Use definition, including
use by businesses, employers, contractors acting for clients, or monetized apps.

